          for 15% incline, lifetime motor cover and no subscription; pick the
          T Series 10 if iFIT's trainer-led classes are what will get you on the
          machine. The table adds the F63's own step-up sibling, the F65. Our
          <a href="/sole-vs-nordictrack/" class="text-[#0F62FE] font-medium">Sole vs NordicTrack comparison</a>
          sets out the two brands side by side.
        </p>
