          $1,099.99 for the F63 at Sole on October 28.
        </p>
        <p>
          Stepping up to the <a href="/sole-f65-treadmill/">Sole F65</a> is a
          harder call than it used to be. Sole's 2026 listing gives it a 3.25 HP
          motor, the same 20 x 60-inch deck and a 350-lb rating for about $200
